        },
        "collapsible_item_AqVGV4": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do you offer chemical- and weather-resistant labels?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we have several options for producing labels resistant to certain chemicals that will hold up in outdoor conditions. Typically (but not always) these will be printed on vinyl with a protective UV coating or laminate.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_mGfw8R": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How long does it take to receive my label proof for approval?",
            "content": "<p>Artwork proofs typically go out within 1 to 2 days of receipt of print-ready art files. If custom design work is required, the timing of this process may be extended.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_zHchqG": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "If I am purchasing for a 3rd party, can you ship without NADCO markings?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. We call this ‘blind shipping’ or ‘drop shipping’. This is specified at the time of order entry and is saved in our system so that our shippers will know not to use any NADCO markings on the package or packing list.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_FyX4Az": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Are your label and tape prices listed on your website?",
            "content": "<p>Some are. Price quoting is done on a case-by-case basis and is dependent on several factors such as size, quantity, and materials needed to complete the job. Quotes are typically presented the same day as requested.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_G4Dyjq": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do you offer private labeling services?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. We can print labels of any kind for any use. We are also tape converters, so if you want to private label your own line of custom-printed masking tape, for example, you’ll want to partner with NADCO since we can do everything under one roof (print and convert the tape, print the labels for your tape, AND package and distribute your tape by the case).</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_WQxWNR": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do you have a minimum label requirement per order?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, on some products. We can print one label for you if that is what you want, but your price will reflect all that is required to make that happen. In other words, you will still pay for press set-up and run time as well as any other materials and tooling required to complete your request. These things, along with raw material costs, will be added to the cost of your order whether you print 1 or 1 million labels. As a result, you will see dramatic drops in price as your volumes increase on your label orders. <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Call us for custom label quotes</a>!</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_zd6xzf": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Industrial Adhesive Tapes and Labels from NADCO",
            "content": "<p>At NADCO Tapes & Labels, customization is our specialty. We can create label and tape products up to 20” wide and print up to 7 spot colors. A small sampling of materials we offer include film, vinyl, duct, and cloth tapes, while our label material options include paper and metal foil, among others. If you have a special project, our R&D department can research it and provide you with an estimated quote. If you can imagine it, NADCO will make it stick!</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> today or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> to learn more about our products and capabilities.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
